 a group can be disabled while others remain interactive."},"280":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-41","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#required-indicator","content":"Mark a checkbox group as required with visual indicator and validation."},"281":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-42","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#invalid-state","content":"Display error state and error message for validation feedback."},"282":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-43","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#customization","content":"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."},"283":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-44","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"284":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-45","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"285":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-46","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"286":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-47","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a checkbox field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive checkbox state:"},"287":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-48","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop displays a minus icon to represent a partial selection state. This is useful for \"select all\" checkboxes when only some items in a collection are selected."},"288":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-49","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"CheckboxGroup supports validation states and error messages:"},"289":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-50","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"},"290":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-51","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"},"291":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-52","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"},"292":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-53","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#orientation","content":"Use `orientation=\"vertical\"` (default) to stack checkboxes, or `orientation=\"horizontal\"` to arrange them in a row."},"293":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-54","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"},"294":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-55","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"},"295":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-56","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"},"296":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-57","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"},"297":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-58","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-required` when selection is required"},"298":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-59","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"},"299":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-60","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"Proper labeling with `aria-labelledby` and `aria-describedby`"},"300":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-61","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state-not-updating","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop must be explicitly managed - it doesn't automatically reflect parent-child relationships:"},"301":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-62","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ For selecting multiple independent options"},"302":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-63","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ When users can select zero, one, or many items"},"303":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-64","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ For toggling settings or features on/off"},"304":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-65","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ When all available options should be visible"},"305":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-66","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"❌ For mutually exclusive options (use Radio instead)"},"306":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-67","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"❌ For simple on/off toggles without labels (use Toggle/Switch instead)"},"307":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-68","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Use clear, concise labels that describe what selecting the option means"},"308":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-69","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Keep labels short (1-5 words when possible)"},"309":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-70","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Ensure labels are descriptive without being verbose"},"310":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-71","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Place the most commonly selected options first in groups"},"311":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-72","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#validation","content":"Always provide clear error messages and use appropriate validation states:"},"312":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-73","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Limit checkbox groups to 7-10 options for better usability"},"313":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-74","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Use logical ordering (alphabetical, frequency of use, or importance)"},"314":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-75","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Consider using CheckboxGroup for related options, even if there are only 2-3"},"315":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-76","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Provide a group label that clearly describes the choice being made"},"316":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"page","content":"CircularProgress","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress"},"317":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-0","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress","content":"A circular progress indicator shows determinate or indeterminate progress of an operation over time"},"318":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-1","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#installation","content":"Installation"},"319":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-2","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#examples","content":"Examples"},"320":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-3","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#default","content":"Default"},"321":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-4","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"322":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-5","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#emphasis","content":"Emphasis"},"323":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-6","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#indeterminate","content":"Indeterminate"},"324":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-7","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"325":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-8","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"ARIA Support"},"326":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-9","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#props","content":"Props"},"327":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-10","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#circularprogress","content":"CircularProgress"},"328":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-11","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#default","content":"A basic determinate progress indicator with a label and helper text."},"329":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-12","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#sizes","content":"Four circle diameters are available: `sm` (64px), `md` (96px), `lg` (128px), and `xl` (160px)."},"330":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-13","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#emphasis","content":"Use the `emphasis` prop to communicate status: `success`, `warning`, or `critical`. When omitted, the default teal fill is used."},"331":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-14","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#indeterminate","content":"Use indeterminate progress while preparing an upload whose total size is unknown.\nOnce the total is known, set `isIndeterminate` to false and supply a measured value."},"332":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-15","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"},"333":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-16","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"},"334":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-17","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"},"335":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-18","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"},"336":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-19","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"},"337":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-20","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"},"338":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-21","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#aria-support","content":"The decorative SVG and output text are hidden via `aria-hidden=\"true\"`"},"339":{"id":"/docs/components/chip","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"page","content":"Chip","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip"},"340":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip","content":"Grouped pill-shaped items for selecting values and removing user-added filters or tokens."},"341":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Features"},"342":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#installation","content":"Installation"},"343":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#quick-start","content":"Quick start"},"344":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"Examples"},"345":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-5","page_id":"/docs/comp