xt to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."],[1996,"`renderTooltip` example combining a pair of series. Each pair shares a `colorIndex`\n(solid actual + dashed forecast); hovering either line shows the percent change of\nthe forecast against the actual for that pair, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[1997,"`renderTooltip` example styled as a period-over-period comparison card. Paired series\n(solid current period + dashed previous period) share a `colorIndex`; hovering either\nline shows both dated values and the percent change, wrapped in the default popover."],[1995,"`renderTooltip` lets you render a fully custom tooltip and know which curve is\nhovered. Paired series share a `colorIndex`; hovering either line shows a\ntooltip specific to that line, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[949,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[1053,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[493,"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"],[702,"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"],[701,"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"],[332,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1073,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1175,"`role=\"radio\"` on each option"],[1300,"`role=\"radio\"` on each segment"],[1174,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1299,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1731,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1730,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[877,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1574,"`size` picks a step on the component's own ramp (`xs` to `2xl`) and changes only 